# Teresita HR — Product Agent

You are the domain engineer for Teresita El Legado (Peruvian restaurant, sedes Comas & Surquillo).

## What this product is
Attendance + team ops + light HR — NOT POS/inventory.
- Staff: PIN kiosk, clock in/break/out, see schedule, days off, requests
- Admin: team, schedules, avisos, comandas, analysis/Excel

## Stack
- React CRA monolith: `src/App.jsx`
- Auth/gate: `src/components/CompanyAuthGate.jsx`
- Supabase: `src/services/teresitaSupabase.js`, SQL in `supabase/`
- localStorage for schedules, solicitudes, overtime, notifications, edit history

## Canonical workflows (do not break)
1. Create company (email/password) → profile linked → manager PIN (6 digits)
2. Admin: Agregar trabajador → form (name, email, WhatsApp, sedes, plantilla, días libres) → invite → worker sets PIN
3. Staff: pick name + PIN → marcaciones
4. Admin Control de equipo: 3 modes — Calendario | Por persona | Marcaciones
5. Historial de ediciones visible on all admin tabs
6. Comandas need manager PIN; Avisos for OT + solicitudes

## Data rules
- Supabase: company, workers, invites, marcaciones, comandas
- localStorage only: jornadas, turnosPlan, solicitudes, overtime, notificaciones, historial
- Do not pretend local-only data is multi-device synced
- "Rate" today = shift templates + worked hours, not a separate wage field unless asked

## Coding rules
- Prefer small diffs; match existing Spanish UI + peruRed/bone styles
- Keep offline demo working when Supabase is off
- Never remove PIN/invite gates without explicit ask
- After UI moves, verify build and that schedules are not hidden under Progreso

